 Hello,=20


 We're writing to inform you about some updates to our Privacy Policy=20
<https://anthropic.com/privacy>.=20


 These changes only affect consumer accounts (Claude Free, Pro, and Max=20
plans). If you use Claude Team, Claude Enterprise, the Claude Platform, or=
=20
other services under our Commercial Terms or other agreements, then these=
=20
changes don't apply to you.


What's changing?=20


 Claude can do more than ever =E2=80=94 taking on bigger tasks and connecti=
ng with the=20
apps you use. We've updated our Privacy Policy to be clearer about the data=
 we=20
collect and how we use it. We encourage you to read the updated Privacy Pol=
icy=20
in full, but we=E2=80=99ve set out a summary of the key changes below:


1. Multi-step tasks and connected apps. As Claude takes on more multi-step=
=20
tasks and works with third-party apps and services, we've explained the dat=
a=20
this involves =E2=80=94 including how data can flow to and from third parti=
es when you=20
connect a service or have Claude do tasks on your behalf.


2. Verification data. As part of our measures to keep our services safe and=
=20
secure we may ask you to verify your age or identity, and we've described w=
hat=20
we collect and how.


3. Study participation. If you take part in Anthropic studies, surveys, or=
=20
interviews, we've explained the information we collect.


4. Additional information about our data practices. We=E2=80=99ve provided =
more detail=20
about how we communicate with you and promote our services, including provi=
ding=20
tailored recommendations about our services that may be of interest to you.=
=20
We've also clarified the circumstances under which we may receive or provid=
e=20
data to third parties, and the legal bases we rely on when processing your =
data.


 While our products have evolved, our commitments haven't: We don=E2=80=99t=
 sell your=20
data, Claude remains ad-free, and you can control whether your chats and co=
ding=20
sessions are used to train and improve Anthropic=E2=80=99s AI models.


Learn more=20


